  "description": "The Luminous Li-On 1250 is a complete, integrated power backup system with a 1280 Wh lithium-ion battery built directly inside the unit, eliminating the need for a separate external battery entirely. Delivering 1100 VA and up to 880W of pure sine wave output, it powers all your essential home appliances — fans, lights, LED television, laptop, refrigerator, Wi-Fi router — with the same clean power quality as your utility grid. Lithium-ion technology transforms the backup experience in three fundamental ways: it charges 3 times faster than conventional lead-acid batteries (so your backup is ready again much sooner after a power cut). No water top-ups. No acid spills. No toxic fumes. No terminal cleaning. No corrosion checks. You simply install it and forget it. The permanently sealed, leak-proof design means it is completely safe to place in any room of your home — living room, study, or bedroom — without any safety concerns. The intelligent BMS (Battery Management System) runs silently in the background, continuously monitoring battery health and optimizing every charge cycle to ensure maximum lifespan and performance. The LCD display gives you clear real-time visibility into battery charge level and estimated backup time. Backed by an industry-leading 8-year (96-month) warranty.",
